{"sections":[{"slug":"配边","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"配边"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"配边"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为广义同调</span> / <span lang=\"zh\">上同调理论</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对一个空间</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">类似于奇异同调考虑</span> $\\Delta^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span>, <strong><span lang=\"zh\">配边</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">则考虑一般的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">维紧流形到</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">配边范畴与拓扑量子场论</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拓扑量子场论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑量子场论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/配边范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到向量空间范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶向量空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的幺半函子</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于拓扑空间</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\Omega_n(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $(N,f)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的等价类的集合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">维紧</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">无边界</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">光滑流形</span>, $f\\colon N\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为光滑映射</span>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/等价关系","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">等价关系</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\sim$ <span lang=\"zh\">如下</span>: $(N,f)\\sim (N',f')$ <span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当存在</span> $(n+1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">维带边流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $\\partial M = N \\sqcup N'$, <span lang=\"zh\">以及映射</span> $g\\colon M\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">限制为</span> $f,f'$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">配边关系的另一种</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">似乎等价的</span>?) <span lang=\"zh\">定义是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">两个映射</span> $X\\to Y,Z\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">配边是指存在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧合映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧合映射</span>"}},{"Plain":" $W\\to Y \\times\\mathbb{R}$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得如下两个方块为横截拉回图</span>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccccc}\r\n\tX &amp; \\to &amp; W &amp; \\leftarrow &amp; Z\\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n\tY &amp; \\to &amp; Y\\times\\mathbb{R} &amp; \\leftarrow &amp; Y\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">上面定义的集合也记作</span> $\\Omega_n^O(X)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">此外还有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/定向配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">定向配边</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Omega_n^{SO}(X)$, "},{"Local":{"url":"/复配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复配边</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/标架配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">标架配边</span>"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">等</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">带结构的配边</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G\\to\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为群同态</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">我们可以定义</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定法丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定法丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">带</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/切结构","text":"$G$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的流形的配边</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">群结构</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">配边类关于无交并</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即定义域的无交并</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">无结构配边类的每个元素为</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶元</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">前推与拉回</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $f \\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导了前推</span> $f_* \\colon N(X)\\to N(Y)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $g\\colon Z \\to Y$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/横截","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">横截</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">那么可定义</span> $f^* g \\colon X\\times_Y Z \\to X$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3>Thom <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></h3>\n<p>Thom <span lang=\"zh\">证明了</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">一个点的</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">无定向配边环同构于</span> $\\mathbb Z/2\\mathbb Z[x_n: n\\in\\mathbb Z_+, n\\neq 2^k-1]$, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $n=2,4,5,6,8,9,\\cdots$, <span lang=\"zh\">且当</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为偶数时</span> $x_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">可取为</span> $\\mathbb RP^n$.</p>\n<p>Thom <span lang=\"zh\">证明了</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">一个点的</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/定向配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">定向配边</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">环</span> $\\Omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\mathbb Q$ <span lang=\"zh\">的张量积</span> (“<span lang=\"zh\">抹去挠元</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">同构于</span> $\\mathbb{Q}[x_{4k}: k\\in\\mathbb Z_+]$, $x_{4k}$ <span lang=\"zh\">可取为</span> $\\mathbb CP^{2k}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对所有序列</span> $I=(i_1,\\cdots,i_k)$, $\\mathbb CP^{i_1}\\times\\cdots\\times \\mathbb CP^{i_k}$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span> $\\Omega\\otimes\\mathbb Q$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $\\mathbb Q$-<span lang=\"zh\">基</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">两个流形在</span> $\\Omega\\otimes\\mathbb Q$ <span lang=\"zh\">中相等当且仅当其所有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Pontryagin数","text":"Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">都相同</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与余同伦的关系</span></h3>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">配边谱</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">配边是一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/广义上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">广义上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">配边群是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定同伦群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定同伦群</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Thom谱","text":"Thom <span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}